      "text": "[6:42PM] #Idumota #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood movement on Adeniji Adele road from Oyebanji intersection via Enu Owa due to diversion for Julius Berger road rehab. \nSmooth flow at Ilubinrin inw Ijora Olopa, Oyingbo, Idumota underneath bridge to Ereko, and Tinubu square to Carter bridge. \nExpect delays at Martins Street due to a fire outbreak at Great Nigeria House. Traffic officers are managing the situation.\n\n#FollowLASTMA \n\n@followlasg \n@lagosMOT1 \n@seunosiyemi_ \n@TrafficChiefNG \n@Sola_Giwa \n@OlalekanOki \n@HeroPrince_21 \n@Mr_JAGs \n@lagostraffic961",
